WEBVTT

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.226
EP: That was a moment for me
where I began to think,

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:05.059
this is way more complicated
than what it looks like.

00:11:05.083 --> 00:11:07.726
What you see isn't necessarily what it is.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.434
And so that's how I look at power.

00:11:09.458 --> 00:11:13.184
I look at the way that,
you know, an eyebrow, you know,

00:11:13.208 --> 00:11:14.476
if one of us was talking

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.726
and the other one
just kind of have that moment

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.018
that says, "Dismissed,"

00:11:18.042 --> 00:11:19.726
with just this, that's power,

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:21.476
that makes you instantly feel like,

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:24.976
you know, you're irrelevant,
you're pushed aside.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.334
AG: I suddenly feel
very conscious of my eyebrows.

00:11:27.358 --> 00:11:28.768
(Laughter)

00:11:28.792 --> 00:11:30.042
Don't look at me.